WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:09.467
Everything was perfect

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:11.928
just like I imagined. 

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:14.305
Please.

00:00:14.305 --> 00:00:15.390
I'm afraid we're going

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:17.058
to spoil this dress.

00:00:22.897 --> 00:00:25.734
Welcome to your home away from home.

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:28.111
This dwelling was built by architect

00:00:28.111 --> 00:00:30.905
Fredric Banner in 1955.

00:00:30.905 --> 00:00:32.282
If I had to be stuck in a house

00:00:32.282 --> 00:00:33.199
it could be worse than this.

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:39.956
Do you think he's watching us?

00:00:40.832 --> 00:00:42.625
Oh, yeah.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:44.794
I remember reading that

00:00:44.794 --> 00:00:47.756
Banner was obsessed with the occult.

00:00:47.756 --> 00:00:49.257
His wife disappeared

00:00:49.257 --> 00:00:51.301
under mysterious circumstances.

00:00:51.426 --> 00:00:53.928
His young son went into foster care.

00:00:53.928 --> 00:00:54.804
Eldridge.

00:00:54.804 --> 00:00:56.222
What’s the address of the house?

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:58.141
1960 Marione Lane.

00:00:58.141 --> 00:00:59.851
I’m in his actual house.

00:01:00.101 --> 00:01:00.810
Hello.

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:02.228
I must have gotten the days mixed up.

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:03.730
We have it booked till tomorrow.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:05.023
I’m Eldridge the owner.

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:09.986
I think I saw someone in this house. 

00:01:10.862 --> 00:01:11.821
I'm worried.

00:01:11.821 --> 00:01:12.947
Just let me know you're okay.

00:01:17.702 --> 00:01:19.120
Do you live here?

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:20.038
I used to.

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:35.178
I think I found some human remains.

00:01:36.304 --> 00:01:37.931
My father committed multiple murders.

00:01:55.365 --> 00:01:57.200
The spirit is able

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:58.868
to escape death.

00:01:58.868 --> 00:02:01.538
Must have been hard watching Eldridge

00:02:01.538 --> 00:02:03.331
turn into his father.

00:02:03.748 --> 00:02:05.208
Help me put an end to him.

